g naturally, whether you’re new to TCM or experienced.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="99c06627-a05b-430e-a737-21a48053944f" class="r-cttp3p" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a88e3fc6-5678-49e6-935c-cf3c403523c3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R12s32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-z8rn3h"><div data-rid="e8cd5e41-5ebe-45f2-b5ed-a39ecd3f6769" class="r-16507x9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use ear seeds alongside medication or other treatments?</p></span></div><div data-rid="b44fb5c0-2edb-466a-b3a1-c1198c8fc397" class="r-r6bhba" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-2efhrc" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R12s32:"><div data-rid="d06ce6a3-6eda-4041-9c25-07f86ab3e767" class="r-1hz0g99"><div data-rid="e884c95d-db93-45fb-9b31-3551eb0589f1" class="r-1cu1xuj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes. Ear seeds are a natural complement to your existing wellness routine. However, if you have specific health concerns, we recommend consulting your healthcare provider.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f7c9cc76-d2cb-4078-9d34-04040b269eac" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="review-sec" tabindex="-1" id="review-sec" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-11ykydp"><div data-rid="14442a45-7866-413a-867d-73f969e617c1" class="r-4r4rgf"><div data-rid="d4301611-ed32-4f81-9cf9-5e911cb55966" class="r-18b0wyu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Customer Reviews</p></span></div><div data-rid="47dce22e-aa59-419c-986e